msgctxt "#30000"
msgid "General"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30001"
msgid "Stream video from apps instead of mirroring"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30002"
msgid "Let apps that support it send a video stream directly instead of mirroring the screen. Video then plays at full quality and the phone's screen can switch off. Only some apps offer this; the rest carry on mirroring."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30003"
msgid "Let the sender change the volume"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30004"
msgid "Move Kodi's volume when the volume is changed on the phone. The phone's slider starts at Kodi's current volume either way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30005"
msgid "Password"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30006"
msgid "Require this password before a sender may connect. Leave empty to let anyone on the network connect."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30007"
msgid "Start mirroring at the live edge"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30008"
msgid "Keep the picture closer to the phone by starting from the newest frame rather than the first one decoded. Leaves less buffer, so a stuttering connection shows sooner. Ignored by a Kodi that does not support it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30009"
msgid "Play sound from mirroring"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30010"
msgid "Sound only reaches Kodi while the phone is making a noise, and the gaps between make the player rebuffer, which adds seconds of delay to the picture. Turn this off for the lowest latency mirroring, at the cost of no sound."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30011"
msgid "How far behind the phone to stay"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30012"
msgid "Smaller means the picture follows the phone more closely, but leaves less room for sound to arrive unevenly, which is what makes it drop out. Raise it if audio breaks up. Applies to the next thing played."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30013"
msgid "{} ms"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30014"
msgid "Offer screen mirroring"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30015"
msgid "Turn off to stop advertising screen mirroring, which is mainly useful for seeing what a sender does without it. Mirroring stops working while it is off, and a phone will stop offering the device for photos entirely."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30016"
msgid "Ask new devices to pair"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30017"
msgid "Show a four digit code the first time a device connects, and remember it once entered so it is not asked again. Forget a device by removing its line from paired-devices in this add-on's data folder."
msgstr ""
